{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Scanpy 1.11.2 的 UMAP 文档说明，较小的 min_dist 会让嵌入点更聚集、成团，因此 min_dist=0.05 相对默认值 0.1 更小，通常会使图更紧凑。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Smaller values will result in a more clustered/clumped embedding where nearby points on the manifold are drawn closer together"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "文档同时指出 min_dist 应相对 spread 设置，spread 决定嵌入点的展开尺度；仅凭 min_dist=0.05 不能无条件断言最终紧凑程度。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "The value should be set relative to the ``spread`` value, which determines the scale at which embedded points will be spread out."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "UMAP 是一种用于高维数据可视化的流形学习技术，其输出是嵌入坐标；文档没有把图中的团块定义为离散生物学细胞类型的证据。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "UMAP (Uniform Manifold Approximation and Projection) is a manifold learning technique suitable for visualizing high-dimensional data."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提出的结论“团块证明离散生物学细胞类型”超出了当前文档支持范围：团块可能反映可视化参数或流形结构，不能仅凭 UMAP 图证明细胞类型是离散的。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
